1
00:00:00,940 --> 00:00:02,340
(Sheldon:)Amy.

2
00:00:02,942 --> 00:00:04,642
Angry Amy?

3
00:00:06,612 --> 00:00:07,672
(Amy(on skype):)What?

4
00:00:08,180 --> 00:00:14,280
(Sheldon:)I've been thinking about what happened,
and I hope this gift will make things better.

5
00:00:16,789 --> 00:00:19,279
(Amy:)Star Trek DVDs?

6
00:00:19,458 --> 00:00:20,788
(Amy:)Why would I want this?

7
00:00:21,460 --> 00:00:22,790
(Sheldon:)First of all, you're welcome.

8
00:00:24,130 --> 00:00:27,360
(Sheldon:)Furthermore, not being familiar
with Wil Wheaton's body of work...

9
00:00:27,533 --> 00:00:31,563
(Sheldon:)...there was no way for you to know
you were being rude to a national treasure.

10
00:00:32,438 --> 00:00:35,428
Get ready for 130 hours of "I told you so."

11
00:00:40,479 --> 00:00:42,849
(Sheldon:)Fine, I'll just tell you what happens.

12
00:00:43,549 --> 00:00:46,679
Episode one, "Encounter at Farpoint."

13
00:00:46,852 --> 00:00:47,912
(Sheldon:)Fade in.

14
00:00:48,087 --> 00:00:50,557
(Sheldon:)The new Enterprise heads out
on its maiden voyage...

15
00:00:50,723 --> 00:00:53,193
(Sheldon:)...to contact the Bandi people of Deneb IV.

16
00:00:53,359 --> 00:01:01,019
(Sheldon:)Enter Wesley Crusher,
played by my buddy...

